---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Pricing — mngd"
  description="Simple, transparent pricing for Apple MDM. Free up to 25 devices with mngd Patch. Full MDM at $8/device/month."
>

  <section class="section pt-28">
    <div class="container">

      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <div class="label mb-4">Pricing</div>
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-semibold text-white tracking-tight mb-4">
          Start free. Scale when you're ready.
        </h1>
        <p class="text-white/50 max-w-lg mx-auto">
          mngd Patch is free up to 25 devices. Full MDM is $8/device/month. MSP pricing available. No hidden fees.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- ── Plan cards ─────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 items-start mb-24">

        <!-- mngd Patch -->
        <div class="card p-6 flex flex-col gap-5">
          <div>
            <div class="inline-flex px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[11px] font-semibold mb-3" style="background:rgba(15,110,86,0.15); color:#0F6E56;">mngd Patch</div>
            <p class="text-xs text-white/40">App and OS patching — no MDM required</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <!-- PRICE -->
            <div class="flex items-end gap-1 mb-1">
              <span class="text-4xl font-semibold text-white">Free</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs text-white/35">1–25 devices, forever. No card required.</p>
            <div class="mt-3 space-y-1">
              <!-- PRICE -->
              <div class="flex justify-between text-xs">
                <span class="text-white/40">26–100 devices</span>
                <span class="text-white font-medium">$99/mo flat</span>
              </div>
              <!-- PRICE -->
              <div class="flex justify-between text-xs">
                <span class="text-white/40">101+ devices</span>
                <span class="text-white font-medium">$0.99/device/mo</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex justify-between text-xs">
                <span class="text-white/40">Monthly billing</span>
                <span class="text-white/50">+20% on paid tiers</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <a href="https://app.mngd.app/register" class="text-center text-sm font-medium py-2 rounded-lg border border-white/10 hover:border-white/20 text-white transition-colors">
            Start free
          </a>
          <ul class="space-y-2.5">
            {[
              '3,000+ apps covered',
              'macOS update tracking',
              'CVE priority scoring',
              'Slack + email alerts',
              'Silent auto-remediation',
              'Policy-based deferral',
              'MSP multi-tenant dashboard',
              'One-flag upgrade to full MDM',
            ].map(f => (
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-white/55">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 mt-0.5 shrink-0" style="color:#0F6E56;" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/>
                </svg>
                {f}
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- mngd (full MDM) — featured -->
        <div class="card p-6 flex flex-col gap-5 border border-white/[0.12] ring-1 ring-inset ring-white/[0.06]" style="background:rgba(45,58,158,0.08);">
          <div>
            <div class="inline-flex px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[11px] font-semibold mb-3" style="background:rgba(45,58,158,0.2); color:#6B82F0;">mngd</div>
            <p class="text-xs text-white/40">Full Apple MDM for your fleet</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <!-- PRICE -->
            <div class="flex items-end gap-1 mb-1">
              <span class="text-4xl font-semibold text-white">$8</span>
              <span class="text-sm text-white/40 mb-1">/device/mo</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs text-white/35">Annual billing · $9.50/device/mo monthly · $80/mo minimum</p>
            <div class="mt-3 space-y-1">
              <div class="flex justify-between text-xs">
                <span class="text-white/40">Annual discount</span>
                <span class="text-white/50">16% vs monthly</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex justify-between text-xs">
                <span class="text-white/40">Minimum</span>
                <span class="text-white/50">10 devices / $80/mo</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <a href="https://app.mngd.app/register" class="text-center text-sm font-medium py-2 rounded-lg text-white transition-colors" style="background:#2D3A9E;">
            Get started
          </a>
          <ul class="space-y-2.5">
            {[
              'Everything in mngd Patch',
              'DDM-native Apple MDM',
              'SCEP device certificates',
              'Apple Business Manager / ADE',
              'VPP app distribution',
              'FileVault + key escrow',
              'Santa allow/deny listing',
              'mSCP compliance baselines',
              'osquery device checks',
              'SAML / OIDC / SCIM',
              'Rules engine + automations',
              'AI-assisted IT queries',
            ].map(f => (
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-white/55">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-blue" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/>
                </svg>
                {f}
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Enterprise -->
        <div class="card p-6 flex flex-col gap-5">
          <div>
            <div class="inline-flex px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[11px] font-semibold mb-3 bg-white/5 text-white/50">Enterprise</div>
            <p class="text-xs text-white/40">For large fleets and compliance-heavy orgs</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <!-- PRICE -->
            <div class="flex items-end gap-1 mb-1">
              <span class="text-4xl font-semibold text-white">$12</span>
              <span class="text-sm text-white/40 mb-1">/device/mo</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs text-white/35">Starting price · contact sales for custom terms</p>
          </div>
          <a href="mailto:hello@mngd.app" class="text-center text-sm font-medium py-2 rounded-lg border border-white/10 hover:border-white/20 text-white/70 hover:text-white transition-colors">
            Contact sales
          </a>
          <ul class="space-y-2.5">
            {[
              'Everything in mngd',
              'Signed MSA with custom DPA',
              '99.9% SLA with credits',
              'Named TAM',
              'HIPAA BAA on request',
              'Priority roadmap input',
              'Custom contract terms',
            ].map(f => (
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-white/55">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-white/30" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/>
                </svg>
                {f}
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>
        </div>

      </div>

      <!-- ── MSP band ────────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
      <div class="card p-8 mb-24 flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center gap-8">
        <div class="flex-1">
          <div class="inline-flex px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[11px] font-semibold mb-3 bg-white/5 text-white/50">MSP</div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white tracking-tight mb-2">Managing multiple customers?</h2>
          <p class="text-sm text-white/50 leading-relaxed max-w-xl">
            MSP pricing is 25% off list — <strong class="text-white/70">$6/device/month</strong> for mngd, monthly billing available, $150/month account minimum.
            Includes multi-tenant dashboard, per-customer isolation, consolidated billing, and deal registration.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex-shrink-0">
          <a href="/for-msps" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg border border-white/10 hover:border-white/20 text-white text-sm font-medium transition-colors">
            See MSP pricing
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"/>
            </svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- ── Volume discounts ────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
      <div class="mb-24 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white tracking-tight mb-6 text-center">Volume discounts</h2>
        <div class="card overflow-hidden">
          <table class="w-full text-sm">
            <thead>
              <tr class="border-b border-white/[0.06]">
                <th class="text-left px-5 py-3 text-xs font-medium text-white/40 uppercase tracking-wider">Devices</th>
                <th class="text-right px-5 py-3 text-xs font-medium text-white/40 uppercase tracking-wider">Discount</th>
                <th class="text-right px-5 py-3 text-xs font-medium text-white/40 uppercase tracking-wider">Effective rate</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              {[
                { range: 'Under 250',    discount: 'List price', rate: '$8.00/device/mo' },
                { range: '250–999',      discount: '10% off',    rate: '$7.20/device/mo' },
                { range: '1,000–4,999',  discount: '20% off',    rate: '$6.40/device/mo' },
                { range: '5,000+',       discount: '30% off',    rate: '$5.60/device/mo' },
              ].map((row, i) => (
                <tr class={i < 3 ? 'border-b border-white/[0.04]' : ''}>
                  <td class="px-5 py-3 text-white/70">{row.range}</td>
                  <td class="px-5 py-3 text-right text-white/50">{row.discount}</td>
                  <td class="px-5 py-3 text-right text-white font-medium">{row.rate}</td>
                </tr>
              ))}
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-white/30 text-center mt-3">Annual billing · applied automatically · contact sales to confirm</p>
      </div>

      <!-- ── FAQ ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
      <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white tracking-tight mb-8 text-center">Common questions</h2>
        <div class="space-y-4">
          {[
            {
              q: 'Can I upgrade from Patch to mngd mid-trial?',
              a: 'Yes. The Patch agent is the same binary as the mngd agent. Upgrading flips a flag server-side — no re-enrollment, no new pkg to deploy, no migration. Your fleet stays in place.',
            },
            {
              q: 'What happens when my trial ends?',
              a: 'mngd Patch has no trial — it\'s free up to 25 devices forever. If you\'re evaluating mngd full MDM, contact us for a trial period.',
            },
            {
              q: 'How is MSP pricing different?',
              a: 'MSP accounts get 25% off list price ($6/device/month for mngd) with a $150/month account minimum. Monthly billing is available. Devices are counted across all customer orgs under your account.',
            },
            {
              q: 'Do you offer annual contracts?',
              a: 'Yes. Annual billing is the default and saves 16% vs monthly on mngd. mngd Patch annual billing saves 20% on paid tiers vs monthly. No minimum contract length required.',
            },
            {
              q: 'How do I cancel?',
              a: 'Cancel any time from your account settings. No cancellation fees, no lock-in. Paid plans downgrade at the end of the current billing period.',
            },
          ].map(faq => (
            <details class="card p-5 group">
              <summary class="text-[15px] font-medium text-white cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
                {faq.q}
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-white/30 shrink-0 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/>
                </svg>
              </summary>
              <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-white/50 leading-relaxed">{faq.a}</p>
            </details>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
